    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>That's a good start for the vibe, but it's a bit too abstract. I need more concrete details to really ground the reader. Can you expand on this by describing the people hanging out on the corners or walking through these streets? I want to make it clear what kind of crowd makes someone feel like they're in a high-crime area—the kind of people that usually trigger a \"stay alert\" instinct in a city.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
